# Machine-local config — paths and secrets. Never commit.
coga.local.toml

# Machine-local Coga state — run records, megalaunch selection, durable
# agent state (`.coga/data/`) and per-launch temporaries (`.coga/tmp/`,
# purged when each launch ends).
.coga/

# Generated merged skill view for agent CLIs. Rebuilt by `coga init`
# and `coga launch`.
.agent-skills/

# Per-domain scaffolding templates (bare `_template`, `_template.md`).
**/_template/
**/_template.md
